PHASE 20 — Firebase Push Notifications

Goal:
Add push notification foundation for web/mobile, especially Owner/Teacher mobile app later.

What to build:
- FCM configuration using env variables.
- Device token registration API.
- Notification sending helper.
- Push notification log.
- Owner notification preferences.

Events for Owner push:
- New payment pending verification
- Student form submitted
- Level check submitted
- Homework submitted
- Scenario submitted
- Review submitted
- Testimonial submitted
- Academy brief submitted
- Booking requested

Events for Student/Parent push later:
- Lesson confirmed
- Lesson reminder
- Homework published
- Homework corrected
- Scenario feedback ready
- Low credits

Security:
- Do not expose Firebase service account.
- Store secrets in environment variables.

Pages:
- /owner/settings/notifications
- /owner/notifications

API:
- POST /api/push/register-device
- POST /api/push/test

Acceptance criteria:
- Device token can be registered.
- Test push can be sent.
- Push events are logged.
- Notification preferences are respected.

Manual test checklist:
- Register token.
- Send test push.
- Trigger homework submission notification.
- Confirm log entry.

